    "body": "Diff looks sane, and to simplify review I generated a list of added HTTPS URLs.\n\n`git show 5ff2abe71f | grep '^+' | grep -oE 'https[^<\" ]*' | sed 's/&lt;.*//' | sort | uniq`\n\n```\nhttps://www.w3.org/2002/06/registering-mediatype.html\nhttps://www.w3.org/2003/entities/\nhttps://www.w3.org/2003/entities/2007doc/\nhttps://www.w3.org/2008/WebVideo/Fragments/WD-media-fragments-spec/\nhttps://www.w3.org/Consortium/\nhttps://www.w3.org/Consortium/#membership\nhttps://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/ipr-notic\nhttps://www.w3.org/Graphics/GIF/spec-gif89a.txt\nhttps://www.w3.org/Graphics/JPEG/jfif3.pdf\nhttps://www.w3.org/International/datespace/2010/02/jlreq-examples/\nhttps://www.w3.org/International/questions/qa-forms-utf-8\nhttps://www.w3.org/MarkUp/future/#summary\nhttps://www.w3.org/People/Berners-Lee/\nhttps://www.w3.org/Press/Stock/Berners-Lee/2001-europaeum-eighth.jpg\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/1999/REC-xpath-19991116/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/1999/REC-xpath-19991116/#dt-expanded-name\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/1999/REC-xpath-19991116/#node-tests\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/1999/REC-xslt-19991116\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/2004/WD-SVG12-20040510/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/2004/WD-SVG12-20041027/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/ATAG20/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/visuren.html#dis-pos-flo\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/MathML/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/MathML3/chapter6.html#world-int-combine-other\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/REC-xml-names#NT-QName\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/SVG/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/SVG/feature.html\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/SVG12/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/SVGMobile12/script.html#ScriptContentProcessing\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/UAAG20/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG20/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/XForms/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/becss/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/charmod/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/css3-color/#css2-system\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/hr-time/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/hr-time/#dom-performance-now\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/html4/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/jlreq/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/jlreq/#positioning_of_jukugoruby\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xforms/slice8.html#ui-commonelems-hint\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml-modularization\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml-names/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml-stylesheet/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml-stylesheet/#the-xml-stylesheet-processing-instruction\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml/\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#AVNormalize\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#NT-Name\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#dt-entref\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-entity-decl\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-well-formed\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#wf-entities\nhttps://www.w3.org/WAI/PF/aria-implementation/\nhttps://www.w3.org/html/wg/lists/\n```\n",
